    "Description": "## Changes\r\n\r\n## 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- feat: allow to store policy assets on oci registry @olblak (#8301)\r\n- chore: move updatecli manifest validate out of experimental @olblak (#10586)\r\n- feat: support relative path, relative to Updatecli manifest files. @olblak (#10150)\r\n- feat(autodiscovery/npm): support vulnerability detection @olblak (#10512)\r\n- feat(autodiscovery/golang): support vulnerability detection @olblak (#10534)\r\n- feat: add vulnerability detection plugin using osv database @olblak (#10497)\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- fix(docker): use TARGETPLATFORM for base image @alecharp (#10584)\r\n- fix: manifest version don't warn on prerelease @olblak (#10554)\r\n- fix(pep440): skip pre-releases when the pattern is a constraint @loispostula (#10546)\r\n- fix: allow to use dynamic info in pipeline name @olblak (#10510)\r\n\r\n## 🧰 Maintenance\r\n\r\n- feat: add release candidate pipeline @olblak (#10553)\r\n- deps(golang): Bump minor version for go.opentelemetry.io module @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10552)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/beevik/etree to v1.8.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10525)\r\n- chore(ci): upgrade uv version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10513)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10498)\r\n- deps: bump Updatecli GH action to v3.7.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10492)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/fluxcd/source-controller/api to v1.9.5 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10488)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/yuin/goldmark to v1.8.6 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10483)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/moby/buildkit to v0.33.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10476)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/drone/go-scm to v1.42.15 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10473)\r\n- deps(go): bump module github.com/google/go-containerregistry to v0.22.1 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10464)\r\n- chore(dockerfile): upgrade node version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10450)\r\n- chore(ci): upgrade uv version @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10441)\r\n- install Updatecli gha workflows v0.121.0 @[updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) (#10430)\r\n- Create issue template for Updatecli release process @olblak (#10410)\r\n\r\n## 📝 Documentation\r\n\r\n- doc: revamp comments used for jsonschema @olblak (#10590)\r\n- doc: update compatibility and versioning information @olblak (#10547)\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\n@alecharp, @loispostula, @olblak, @updateclibot[bot], [updateclibot[bot]](https://github.com/apps/updateclibot) and updatecli\r\n\r\n## Sponsors\r\n\r\nIf Updatecli is useful to you, please consider sponsoring it.  \r\nYour support helps maintain and improve this project.\r\n\r\n[![GitHub stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/updatecli/updatecli?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/updatecli/updatecli/stargazers) [![Sponsor](https://img.shields.io/badge/Sponsor-%E2%9D%A4-pink?style=for-the-badge)](https://www.updatecli.io/support/#sponsor-or-donate)",
